{"owner": "soolbam5498", "repo": "soolbam-landing", "branch": "main", "message": "Add Sulbam landing page, workflow, and planning doc", "files": [{"path": "index.html", "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n  <meta name=\"description\" content=\"제주의 밤을 담다 — 감성 요리 주점 술밤. 제주 딱새우, 숙성 연어회와 안주 메뉴.\" />\n  <title>술밤 Sulbam — 감성 요리 주점</title>\n  <!-- Pretendard 웹폰트 -->\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.min.css\" />\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n  <script>\n    tailwind.config = {\n      theme: {\n        extend: {\n          colors: {\n            sulbam: {\n              pink: '#F5B0E6',\n              blue: '#4090E3',\n              lime: '#D2E05C',\n              orange: '#EDB652',\n              red: '#E35874',\n            },\n          },\n          fontFamily: {\n            sans: ['Pretendard', 'system-ui', 'sans-serif'],\n          },\n        },\n      },\n    };\n  </script>\n  <style>\n    /* 헤더 스크롤 시 배경 전환 */\n    header.is-scrolled {\n      background-color: rgba(64, 144, 227, 0.92);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n      box-shadow: 0 4px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);\n    }\n    /* 메뉴 탭 패널 전환 */\n    .menu-panel {\n      display: none;\n    }\n    .menu-panel.is-active {\n      display: block;\n    }\n    /* 히어로: 딱새우·연어회 분할 배경 */\n    .hero-split-bg {\n      display: flex;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 100%;\n    }\n    .hero-split-bg > div {\n      flex: 1;\n      background-size: cover;\n      background-position: center;\n    }\n    html {\n      scroll-behavior: smooth;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-white text-neutral-900 antialiased font-sans\">\n\n  <!-- ========== Header ========== -->\n  <header\n    id=\"site-header\"\n    class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 transition-colors duration-300 bg-transparent\"\n    role=\"banner\"\n  >\n    <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl items-center justify-between px-4 py-4 md:px-6\">\n      <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white drop-shadow-md md:text-2xl\">\n        Sulbam <span class=\"font-normal text-white/90\">술밤</span>\n      </a>\n      <nav class=\"flex gap-6 text-sm font-medium md:gap-10 md:text-base\" aria-label=\"주요 메뉴\">\n        <a\n          href=\"#about\"\n          class=\"nav-link text-white drop-shadow transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-sulbam-pink focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white\"\n        >About</a>\n        <a\n          href=\"#menu\"\n          class=\"nav-link text-white drop-shadow transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-sulbam-pink focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white\"\n        >Menu</a>\n        <a\n          href=\"#location\"\n          class=\"nav-link text-white drop-shadow transition-colors duration-200 hover:text-sulbam-pink focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white\"\n        >Location</a>\n      </nav>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <main>\n    <!-- ========== Hero ========== -->\n    <section\n      class=\"relative flex min-h-[88vh] items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-neutral-900 px-4 pt-24 pb-16\"\n      aria-labelledby=\"hero-heading\"\n    >\n      <!-- 배경: 제주 딱새우 + 숙성 연어회 (pic) -->\n      <div class=\"absolute inset-0 hero-split-bg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"제주 딱새우와 연어회\">\n        <div style=\"background-image: url('pic/shrimp.jpg');\" class=\"min-h-full\"></div>\n        <div style=\"background-image: url('pic/salmon_sashimi.jpg');\" class=\"min-h-full border-l border-white/20\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-black/55 via-black/45 to-black/70\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center\">\n        <p class=\"mb-3 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sulbam-lime md:text-base\">\n          Jeju Night Dining\n        </p>\n        <h1 id=\"hero-heading\" class=\"mb-8 text-3xl font-bold leading-tight text-white drop-shadow-lg md:text-5xl lg:text-6xl\">\n          제주의 밤을 담다,<br class=\"hidden sm:inline\" />\n          감성 요리 주점 술밤\n        </h1>\n        <a\n          href=\"#menu\"\n          class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-sulbam-red px-10 py-4 text-base font-semibold text-white shadow-lg transition hover:bg-[#d94a66] hover:shadow-xl focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white\"\n        >\n          메뉴 보기\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ========== About ========== -->\n    <section id=\"about\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 bg-neutral-50 py-16 md:py-24\" aria-labelledby=\"about-heading\">\n      <div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-10 px-4 md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center md:gap-14 md:px-6\">\n        <article class=\"order-2 md:order-1\">\n          <h2 id=\"about-heading\" class=\"mb-6 text-2xl font-bold text-neutral-900 md:text-3xl\">\n            브랜드 스토리\n          </h2>\n          <p class=\"mb-4 leading-relaxed text-neutral-700\">\n            술밤은 제주에서 올라온 <strong class=\"font-semibold text-sulbam-lime\">신선함</strong>을 한 접시에 담아내는 감성 요리 주점입니다.\n            매장은 따뜻한 조명과 편안한 좌석으로 오래 머물고 싶은 분위기를 지향합니다.\n          </p>\n          <p class=\"leading-relaxed text-neutral-700\">\n            시그니처인 <span class=\"font-semibold text-sulbam-lime\">제주 딱새우</span>와 숙성 연어회는 매일 들어오는 식재료를 바탕으로 준비됩니다.\n            안주 한 접시, 술 한 잔으로 제주의 밤을 옮겨 드립니다.\n          </p>\n        </article>\n        <div class=\"order-1 md:order-2 space-y-4\">\n          <figure class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-xl ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n            <img\n              src=\"pic/Restaurant_interior_01.jpg\"\n              alt=\"술밤 매장 내부 분위기\"\n              class=\"h-full w-full object-cover aspect-[4/3]\"\n              width=\"800\"\n              height=\"600\"\n              loading=\"lazy\"\n            />\n          </figure>\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 sm:grid-cols-4\">\n            <img src=\"pic/Restaurant_interior_02.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"aspect-square rounded-lg object-cover ring-1 ring-black/5\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n            <img src=\"pic/Restaurant_interior_03.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"aspect-square rounded-lg object-cover ring-1 ring-black/5\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n            <img src=\"pic/Restaurant_interior_04.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"aspect-square rounded-lg object-cover ring-1 ring-black/5\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n            <img src=\"pic/soolbam.jpg\" alt=\"술밤 매장 외관\" class=\"aspect-square rounded-lg object-cover object-center ring-1 ring-black/5\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ========== Menu ========== -->\n    <section id=\"menu\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 bg-white py-16 md:py-24\" aria-labelledby=\"menu-heading\">\n      <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 md:px-6\">\n        <h2 id=\"menu-heading\" class=\"mb-4 text-center text-2xl font-bold md:text-3xl\">\n          메뉴\n        </h2>\n        <p class=\"mx-auto mb-10 max-w-2xl text-center text-neutral-600\">\n          세트부터 회·찜, 요리·사이드까지 — 술과 어울리는 메뉴를 골라보세요.\n        </p>\n\n        <!-- BEST 세트 (Orange 테두리) -->\n        <article\n          class=\"mb-12 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border-4 border-sulbam-orange bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50/80 to-white shadow-md\"\n          aria-label=\"BEST 추천 세트\"\n        >\n          <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 gap-0.5 bg-sulbam-orange/30 sm:gap-1\">\n            <img src=\"pic/shrimp.jpg\" alt=\"제주 딱새우회\" class=\"aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n            <img src=\"pic/Fried_Shrimp_Heads.jpg\" alt=\"머리튀김\" class=\"aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n            <img src=\"pic/Seafood_Ramyeon.jpg\" alt=\"해물라면\" class=\"aspect-[4/3] w-full object-cover\" width=\"400\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"p-6 md:p-8\">\n            <div class=\"mb-4 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2\">\n              <span class=\"rounded-full bg-sulbam-orange px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-white\">\n                BEST\n              </span>\n              <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-neutral-600\">대표 세트</span>\n            </div>\n            <h3 class=\"mb-2 text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900 md:text-2xl\">\n              제주 딱새우회 + 머리튀김 + 해물라면\n            </h3>\n            <p class=\"mb-4 text-sm text-neutral-600\">\n              신선한 회, 바삭한 머리튀김, 시원한 해물라면을 한 상에.\n            </p>\n            <p class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink md:text-3xl\">50,000원</p>\n          </div>\n        </article>\n\n        <!-- 탭 버튼 -->\n        <div\n          class=\"mb-8 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2 md:gap-3\"\n          role=\"tablist\"\n          aria-label=\"메뉴 카테고리\"\n        >\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            role=\"tab\"\n            aria-selected=\"true\"\n            aria-controls=\"panel-set\"\n            id=\"tab-set\"\n            data-tab=\"set\"\n            class=\"menu-tab rounded-full border-2 border-sulbam-blue bg-sulbam-blue px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:opacity-90 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-sulbam-blue\"\n          >\n            세트\n          </button>\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            role=\"tab\"\n            aria-selected=\"false\"\n            aria-controls=\"panel-hoe\"\n            id=\"tab-hoe\"\n            data-tab=\"hoe\"\n            class=\"menu-tab rounded-full border-2 border-neutral-200 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-700 transition hover:border-sulbam-blue hover:text-sulbam-blue focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-sulbam-blue\"\n          >\n            회 · 찜\n          </button>\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            role=\"tab\"\n            aria-selected=\"false\"\n            aria-controls=\"panel-yori\"\n            id=\"tab-yori\"\n            data-tab=\"yori\"\n            class=\"menu-tab rounded-full border-2 border-neutral-200 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-700 transition hover:border-sulbam-blue hover:text-sulbam-blue focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-sulbam-blue\"\n          >\n            요리\n          </button>\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            role=\"tab\"\n            aria-selected=\"false\"\n            aria-controls=\"panel-side\"\n            id=\"tab-side\"\n            data-tab=\"side\"\n            class=\"menu-tab rounded-full border-2 border-neutral-200 bg-white px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-700 transition hover:border-sulbam-blue hover:text-sulbam-blue focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-sulbam-blue\"\n          >\n            사이드\n          </button>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 세트 패널 -->\n        <div id=\"panel-set\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-set\" class=\"menu-panel is-active\">\n          <ul class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n            <li class=\"flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 shadow-sm\">\n              <img src=\"pic/salmon_sashimi.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-40 w-full object-cover\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n              <div class=\"p-5\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-neutral-900\">딱새우회/연어회+머리튀김+해물라면</h4>\n                <p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">62,000원</p>\n              </div>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 shadow-sm\">\n              <img src=\"pic/Fried_Shrimp_Heads.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-40 w-full object-cover\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n              <div class=\"p-5\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-neutral-900\">제주딱새우회/찜+머리튀김+해물라면</h4>\n                <p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">58,000원</p>\n              </div>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 shadow-sm\">\n              <img src=\"pic/Seafood_Ramyeon.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-40 w-full object-cover\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n              <div class=\"p-5\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-neutral-900\">제주 딱새우찜+머리튀김+해물라면</h4>\n                <p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">52,000원</p>\n              </div>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 shadow-sm\">\n              <img src=\"pic/shrimp.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-40 w-full object-cover\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n              <div class=\"p-5\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-neutral-900\">제주 딱새우회+머리튀김+해물라면</h4>\n                <p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">50,000원</p>\n              </div>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 shadow-sm\">\n              <img src=\"pic/salmon_sashimi.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-40 w-full object-cover\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n              <div class=\"p-5\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-neutral-900\">제주 딱새우회+숙성 연어회</h4>\n                <p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">47,000원</p>\n              </div>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 shadow-sm\">\n              <img src=\"pic/shrimp.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-40 w-full object-cover\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n              <div class=\"p-5\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-neutral-900\">딱새우회+딱새우찜</h4>\n                <p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">43,000원</p>\n              </div>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 회 · 찜 패널 -->\n        <div id=\"panel-hoe\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-hoe\" class=\"menu-panel\" hidden>\n          <ul class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n            <li class=\"flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-sulbam-blue/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50/50 to-white shadow-sm\">\n              <img src=\"pic/shrimp.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-40 w-full object-cover\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n              <div class=\"p-5\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-neutral-900\">제주 딱새우</h4>\n                <p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-neutral-500\">제주에서 올린 신선함</p>\n                <p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">35,000원</p>\n              </div>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-sulbam-blue/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50/50 to-white shadow-sm\">\n              <img src=\"pic/salmon_sashimi.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-40 w-full object-cover\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n              <div class=\"p-5\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-neutral-900\">술밤 숙성 연어회</h4>\n                <p class=\"mt-1 text-xs text-neutral-500\">숙성의 깊은 맛</p>\n                <p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">35,000원</p>\n              </div>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 shadow-sm sm:col-span-2 lg:col-span-1\">\n              <img src=\"pic/shrimp.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-40 w-full object-cover\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n              <div class=\"p-5\">\n                <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-neutral-900\">딱새우찜 <span class=\"text-sm font-normal text-neutral-600\">(머리튀김 +3,000원)</span></h4>\n                <p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">37,000원</p>\n              </div>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 요리 패널 -->\n        <div id=\"panel-yori\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-yori\" class=\"menu-panel\" hidden>\n          <ul class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n            <li class=\"rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 p-5 shadow-sm\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">백골뱅이탕</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">32,000원</p></li>\n            <li class=\"flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 shadow-sm\">\n              <img src=\"pic/Grilled_Chilean_Sea_Bass.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-40 w-full object-cover\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n              <div class=\"p-5\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">메로메로구이</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">30,000원</p></div>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 p-5 shadow-sm\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">민물장어 양념구이</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">26,000원</p></li>\n            <li class=\"flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 shadow-sm\">\n              <img src=\"pic/Seafood_Ramyeon.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-40 w-full object-cover\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n              <div class=\"p-5\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">해물 토마토 국물 파스탕</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">20,000원</p></div>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 p-5 shadow-sm\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">눈꽃치즈 로제파스타</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">18,000원</p></li>\n            <li class=\"rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 p-5 shadow-sm\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">청양 크림 파스타</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">18,000원</p></li>\n            <li class=\"rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 p-5 shadow-sm\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">오돌갈비 직화구이</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">20,000원</p></li>\n            <li class=\"rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 p-5 shadow-sm\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">떡갈비 직화구이</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">20,000원</p></li>\n            <li class=\"rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 p-5 shadow-sm\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">부산 미도 어묵탕</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">18,000원</p></li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- 사이드 패널 -->\n        <div id=\"panel-side\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"tab-side\" class=\"menu-panel\" hidden>\n          <ul class=\"grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3\">\n            <li class=\"rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 p-5 shadow-sm\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">먹태 버터구이</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">8,000원</p></li>\n            <li class=\"rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 p-5 shadow-sm\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">케이준 감자튀김</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">8,000원</p></li>\n            <li class=\"rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 p-5 shadow-sm\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">파인샤베트</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">8,000원</p></li>\n            <li class=\"rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 p-5 shadow-sm\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">크림치즈볼</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">8,000원</p></li>\n            <li class=\"flex flex-col overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50/80 shadow-sm\">\n              <img src=\"pic/Corn_Cheese.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"h-40 w-full object-cover\" width=\"400\" height=\"260\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n              <div class=\"p-5\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold\">콘치즈</h4><p class=\"mt-2 text-xl font-bold text-sulbam-pink\">6,000원</p></div>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ========== Location ========== -->\n    <section id=\"location\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 bg-neutral-50 py-16 md:py-24\" aria-labelledby=\"location-heading\">\n      <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 md:px-6\">\n        <h2 id=\"location-heading\" class=\"mb-10 text-center text-2xl font-bold md:text-3xl\">\n          위치 · 예약\n        </h2>\n        <div class=\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:items-start\">\n          <!-- 정적 지도: 오픈스트리트맵 임베드 (실제 주소로 교체 가능) -->\n          <div class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl shadow-lg ring-1 ring-black/5\">\n            <iframe\n              title=\"매장 위치 지도 (관악구 신림)\"\n              class=\"h-72 w-full md:h-96\"\n              loading=\"lazy\"\n              referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer-when-downgrade\"\n              src=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/export/embed.html?bbox=126.9244%2C37.4822%2C126.9322%2C37.4870&amp;layer=mapnik\"\n            ></iframe>\n            <p class=\"bg-neutral-100 px-4 py-2 text-center text-xs text-neutral-500\">\n              정확한 위치는 <a href=\"https://map.naver.com/v5/search/%EA%B4%80%EC%95%85%EA%B5%AC%20%EC%8B%A0%EB%A6%BC%EB%A1%9C59%EA%B8%B8%2015-6\" class=\"text-sulbam-blue underline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">네이버 지도에서 주소 검색</a>으로 확인할 수 있습니다.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n          <article class=\"space-y-6\">\n            <dl class=\"space-y-4 text-neutral-800\">\n              <div>\n                <dt class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-500\">주소</dt>\n                <dd class=\"mt-1 text-lg\">\n                  서울특별시 관악구 신림로59길 15-6 1층\n                </dd>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <dt class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-500\">영업시간</dt>\n                <dd class=\"mt-1 space-y-1\">\n                  <p>화 · 수 · 목 · 금 · 토 — 오후 6시 30분 ~ 새벽 2시</p>\n                  <p>일 — 오후 6시 ~ 새벽 1시</p>\n                  <p class=\"text-neutral-600\">매주 월요일 정기 휴무</p>\n                </dd>\n              </div>\n              <div>\n                <dt class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-neutral-500\">전화</dt>\n                <dd class=\"mt-1\">\n                  <a href=\"tel:+821071195498\" class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-sulbam-blue hover:underline\">010-7119-5498</a>\n                </dd>\n              </div>\n            </dl>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\">\n              <a\n                href=\"https://booking.naver.com\"\n                target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n                class=\"inline-flex flex-1 min-w-[140px] items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-sulbam-blue px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-white shadow transition hover:bg-[#3578c9] focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-sulbam-blue\"\n              >\n                네이버 예약하기\n              </a>\n              <a\n                href=\"tel:+821071195498\"\n                class=\"inline-flex flex-1 min-w-[140px] items-center justify-center rounded-xl border-2 border-sulbam-blue bg-white px-6 py-3.5 font-semibold text-sulbam-blue transition hover:bg-blue-50 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-sulbam-blue\"\n              >\n                전화 걸기\n              </a>\n            </div>\n          </article>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- ========== Footer ========== -->\n  <footer class=\"bg-neutral-950 py-12 text-neutral-400\" role=\"contentinfo\">\n    <div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col items-center gap-6 px-4 text-center md:flex-row md:justify-between md:text-left md:px-6\">\n      <div>\n        <p class=\"text-lg font-bold text-neutral-200\">Sulbam 술밤</p>\n        <p class=\"mt-2 text-sm\">© <span id=\"year\"></span> 술밤. All rights reserved.</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n        <a\n          href=\"https://www.instagram.com/\"\n          target=\"_blank\"\n          rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\n          class=\"inline-flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-neutral-800 text-neutral-300 transition hover:bg-neutral-700 hover:text-white focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-white\"\n          aria-label=\"술밤 인스타그램\"\n        >\n          <!-- 간단 SVG 인스타 아이콘 -->\n          <svg class=\"h-5 w-5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path d=\"M12 2.163c3.204 0 3.584.012 4.85.07 3.252.148 4.771 1.691 4.919 4.919.058 1.265.069 1.645.069 4.849 0 3.205-.012 3.584-.069 4.849-.149 3.225-1.664 4.771-4.919 4.919-1.266.058-1.644.07-4.85.07-3.204 0-3.584-.012-4.849-.07-3.26-.149-4.771-1.699-4.919-4.92-.058-1.265-.07-1.644-.07-4.849 0-3.204.013-3.583.07-4.849.149-3.227 1.664-4.771 4.919-4.919 1.266-.057 1.645-.069 4.849-.069zm0-2.163c-3.259 0-3.667.014-4.947.072-4.358.2-6.78 2.618-6.98 6.98-.059 1.281-.073 1.689-.073 4.948 0 3.259.014 3.668.072 4.948.2 4.358 2.618 6.78 6.98 6.98 1.281.058 1.689.072 4.948.072 3.259 0 3.668-.014 4.948-.072 4.354-.2 6.782-2.618 6.979-6.98.059-1.28.073-1.689.073-4.948 0-3.259-.014-3.667-.072-4.947-.196-4.354-2.617-6.78-6.979-6.98-1.281-.059-1.69-.073-4.949-.073zm0 5.838c-3.403 0-6.162 2.759-6.162 6.162s2.759 6.163 6.162 6.163 6.162-2.759 6.162-6.163c0-3.403-2.759-6.162-6.162-6.162zm0 10.162c-2.209 0-4-1.79-4-4 0-2.209 1.791-4 4-4s4 1.791 4 4c0 2.21-1.791 4-4 4zm6.406-11.845c-.796 0-1.441.645-1.441 1.44s.645 1.44 1.441 1.44c.795 0 1.439-.645 1.439-1.44s-.644-1.44-1.439-1.44z\"/>\n          </svg>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <script>\n    (function () {\n      'use strict';\n\n      // --- 헤더: 스크롤 시 Blue 반투명 배경 ---\n      var header = document.getElementById('site-header');\n      var navLinks = document.querySelectorAll('.nav-link');\n\n      function updateHeader() {\n        var scrolled = window.scrollY > 40;\n        header.classList.toggle('is-scrolled', scrolled);\n        /* 상단 투명 구간에서는 글자 가독성을 위해 그림자 유지 */\n        navLinks.forEach(function (el) {\n          el.classList.toggle('drop-shadow', !scrolled);\n        });\n      }\n\n      window.addEventListener('scroll', updateHeader, { passive: true });\n      updateHeader();\n\n      // --- 메뉴 탭 ---\n      var tabButtons = document.querySelectorAll('.menu-tab');\n      var panels = {\n        set: document.getElementById('panel-set'),\n        hoe: document.getElementById('panel-hoe'),\n        yori: document.getElementById('panel-yori'),\n        side: document.getElementById('panel-side'),\n      };\n\n      var activeClasses = ['border-sulbam-blue', 'bg-sulbam-blue', 'text-white'];\n      var inactiveClasses = ['border-neutral-200', 'bg-white', 'text-neutral-700'];\n\n      function showTab(name) {\n        Object.keys(panels).forEach(function (key) {\n          var panel = panels[key];\n          if (!panel) return;\n          if (key === name) {\n            panel.classList.add('is-active');\n            panel.removeAttribute('hidden');\n          } else {\n            panel.classList.remove('is-active');\n            panel.setAttribute('hidden', '');\n          }\n        });\n\n        tabButtons.forEach(function (btn) {\n          var tabName = btn.getAttribute('data-tab');\n          var isActive = tabName === name;\n          btn.setAttribute('aria-selected', isActive ? 'true' : 'false');\n          activeClasses.forEach(function (c) {\n            btn.classList.toggle(c, isActive);\n          });\n          inactiveClasses.forEach(function (c) {\n            btn.classList.toggle(c, !isActive);\n          });\n        });\n      }\n\n      tabButtons.forEach(function (btn) {\n        btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n          var name = btn.getAttribute('data-tab');\n          if (name) showTab(name);\n        });\n      });\n\n      // 푸터 연도\n      var y = document.getElementById('year');\n      if (y) y.textContent = new Date().getFullYear();\n    })();\n  </script>\n</body>\n</html>\n"}, {"path": "웹사이트기획안.markdown", "content": "0. Header (Navigation)\n구성: 좌측 로고(Sulbam), 우측 메뉴(About, Menu, Location).\n\n디자인: 상단 고정(sticky), 투명 배경에 스크롤 시 #4090E3(Blue) 반투명 배경 적용.\n\n효과: 메뉴 호버 시 #F5B0E6(Pink) 색상으로 텍스트 변경.\n\n1. Hero Section (첫 화면)\n비주얼: 제주 딱새우와 연어회의 고화질 이미지를 배경으로 활용.\n\n슬로건: \"제주의 밤을 담다, 감성 요리 주점 술밤\"\n\nCTA 버튼: [메뉴 보기] - #E35874(Red) 배경색 적용, 클릭 시 메뉴 섹션으로 이동.\n\n2. About Section (브랜드 스토리)\n콘텐츠: 매장 분위기와 신선한 식재료(제주 딱새우)에 대한 설명.\n\n디자인: 좌측 텍스트, 우측 매장 내부 사진 배치.\n\n컬러 포인트: #D2E05C(Lime) 색상의 강조 텍스트 사용 (\"신선함\" 강조).\n\n3. Menu Section (메인 콘텐츠)\n레이아웃: 탭 시스템 또는 그리드 시스템 (Tab: 세트/회/요리/사이드).\n\n주요 구성: 메뉴에 맞는 사진이 있으면 같이 배치\n\nBEST 세트: 딱새우회+머리튀김+해물라면 세트를 카드 상단에 배치 (테두리 #EDB652 Orange).\n\n회/찜 시리즈: 제주 딱새우와 숙성 연어의 신선함을 강조하는 카드 디자인.\n\n안주류: 파스탕, 직화구이 등 요리류 배치.\n\n가격 표시: 모든 가격은 #F5B0E6(Pink) 색상으로 굵게 표시하여 시인성 확보.\n\n4. Location Section (위치 및 예약)\n지도: 네이버 지도 API 또는 정적 이미지 링크.\n\n정보: 주소: 관악구 신림로59길 15-6 1층, 영업시간: 화수목금토 오후6시30분~새벽2시 / 일 오후6시 ~새벽1시 / 매주 월요일 정기휴무, 전화번호 : 010-7119-5498.\n\n버튼: [네이버 예약하기] 또는 [전화 걸기] 버튼 배치 (#4090E3 Blue).\n\n5. Footer\n콘텐츠: 로고, SNS 아이콘(인스타그램 링크), 카피라이트.\n\n컬러: 배경색을 아주 어두운 무채색으로 설정하고 텍스트는 밝은 회색 적용."}, {"path": ".nojekyll", "content": ""}, {"path": ".github/workflows/deploy-pages.yml", "content": "# GitHub Pages: 정적 파일을 Actions로 배포\nname: Deploy to GitHub Pages\n\non:\n  push:\n    branches: [main]\n  workflow_dispatch:\n\npermissions:\n  contents: read\n  pages: write\n  id-token: write\n\nconcurrency:\n  group: pages\n  cancel-in-progress: false\n\njobs:\n  deploy:\n    environment:\n      name: github-pages\n      url: ${{ steps.deployment.outputs.page_url }}\n    runs-on: ubuntu-latest\n    steps:\n      - name: Checkout\n        uses: actions/checkout@v4\n      - name: Setup Pages\n        uses: actions/configure-pages@v5\n      - name: Upload artifact\n        uses: actions/upload-pages-artifact@v3\n        with:\n          path: .\n      - name: Deploy to GitHub Pages\n        id: deployment\n        uses: actions/deploy-pages@v4\n"}]}